## Your Rights and Choices

### Sign Out

You may sign out of Progressive Memory Game at any time. Signing out removes your active login session from the browser.

### Reset Game Progress

You can reset your game progress by:

* Using in-game reset options (if available)
* Clearing browser storage
* Removing cookies and site data

### Delete Stored Information

Since most information is stored locally, you may delete all game-related information by:

* Clearing browser local storage
* Clearing cookies
* Using your browser's "Clear Site Data" feature

